  "The value proposition works when people get past the wall: simplicity praise 22 (10.68%, mean 4.68) stable across seven years and languages (Russian 6, US 5, BR 3, CA 3, UA 2, BY, LV, VN) — 'Very simple and clear interface… nothing extra'; 'there is no any unnecessary tools for me'; 'the most comprehensive application without fluff'; 'It's not over-engineered'; behaviour change 14 (6.80%, mean 4.93) — losing weight, quitting alcohol, daily meditation, tracking expenses, brushing teeth",
